.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-296.log:484:168:Two committed claims at the same `(entity_id, claim_type, field_path)` with different `claim_text` are a contradiction. Contradictions are **never auto-resolved**. Both claims remain in `claim_state = 'committed'` with a contradiction marker:
