.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:799:If all four fail, `source_asof = None` AND the Provenance envelope emits a new warning variant:
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:822:The freshness factor uses an explicit fallback chain — **conservative on unknown**:
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:825:freshness_input_age = match (source_asof, observed_at):
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:835:The builder lifts `itemSource.sourcedAt` (when present in LLM output) and Glean document timestamps into `source_asof` automatically. Authors do not manually populate the field. The builder emits `SourceTimestampUnknown` when the population chain falls to step 4.
