.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:842:| DOS-5 (Trust Compiler, spine) | `freshness_weight` factor uses the fallback chain in §B above. Conservative on unknown. |
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:844:| DOS-218 / DOS-219 (pilot abilities, spine) | Acceptance criteria include: produces ≥1 claim with `source_asof` populated and ≥1 claim with `SourceTimestampUnknown` warning, demonstrating the chain works both ways. |
