.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-294.log:262:566:- L3 wave adversarial: codex-challenge + architect-reviewer + **Suite S report** (auth/authz on `invoke_ability`, MCP actor-filter discovery, schema-validation on input JSON, capability-handle leakage) + **Suite P report** (trust math at claim-volume — within p99 < 5ms provisional) + **Suite E report** (cross-entity-coherence factor lights up on bundle-1 fixture; bundle-5 correction-resurrection green)
