.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-294.log:469:- [ADR-0114: Scoring Unification](0114-scoring-unification.md) — `user_feedback_weight` factor consumes the typed action; R1.3 `UserFeedbackInput` shape adopted here.
